{"id":"faults-behind-in-front","rev":2,"lang":"cs","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Za terčem, před terčem, nad, pod, škrtnutý","summary":"Co znamenají „za terčem“, „před terčem“, „nad“, „pod“ a „škrtnutý“, co obvykle způsobuje každou z těchto chyb a jak se škrtnutý terč počítá.","body":[{"k":"faults-behind-in-front-p1","t":"p","html":"Každá chyba má směr. Trenér, který stojí za střelcem, obvykle nejdřív řekne, kam šla rána vzhledem k terči, a teprve potom proč.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"dg-miss-directions","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-miss-directions\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-miss-directions\">Kam šly broky: za, před, nad, pod</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"40 10 640 372\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-miss-directions\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"dg-fly\" d=\"M60 190 H592\"/><path class=\"dg-flyh\" d=\"M592 182 l14 8 -14 8z\"/>\n<circle class=\"dg-pat\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"190\" r=\"52\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"210.0\" cy=\"190.0\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"187.5\" cy=\"201.5\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"202.1\" cy=\"166.1\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"218.9\" cy=\"214.6\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"162.6\" cy=\"183.4\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"238.0\" cy=\"165.9\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"196.9\" cy=\"201.6\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"191.2\" cy=\"173.1\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"224.4\" cy=\"198.9\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"169.5\" cy=\"202.6\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"217.0\" cy=\"153.8\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"214.0\" cy=\"234.9\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"187.9\" cy=\"183.0\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"220.5\" cy=\"185.5\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"183.9\" cy=\"212.9\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"195.5\" cy=\"155.3\" r=\"2.2\"/><circle class=\"dg-sh\" cx=\"